2. The full topic name will be prefixed by category, marketplace and encoding for observability to easily find it out since you can have both avro and json
For the above, the full topic name is {{marketplace.avro.ml.hello_world}}

3. Schema Loader - it's a pointer to a function that returns the schema for the topic.
All the event buffer producers use the same loader that takes the schemas from common/kafka/resources
[https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/blob/e3df5bc87b5fda33e4c0eda01d2aad3f2c4eb5a1/common/kafka/KafkaFactoryDefaultsWrapper.ts#L5|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/blob/e3df5bc87b5fda33e4c0eda01d2aad3f2c4eb5a1/common/kafka/KafkaFactoryDefaultsWrapper.ts#L5]
It's mandatory for the loader to return the content of the schema.
For instance, for the above, the argument will be "{{ml.hello_world}}", and the provider loader must return the schema.

